{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:3/30/3q2n4vsg3dg13yw2c6x1608uftjdoe0.mp3","text":"炎国数百年前就已经没有“棋待诏”这一官职，而你竟然......只是想让我帮你处理这些文书？不，我不明白你说的“分身乏术”是什么意思。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_001.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/a7lstjsieuivqgahzy92866u4fysmew.mp3","text":"炎国数百年前就已经没有“棋待诏”这一官职，而你竟然......只是想让我帮你处理这些文书？不，我不明白你说的“分身乏术”是什么意思。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/36/aa4dl6ev6xvxvqnzn0l47c8rr6wmz4s.mp3","text":"这几日在罗德岛为客，要是有可以替你分忧的地方，自当出力。可是医疗公司的种种事务，你也不必问计于我......手谈一局？等你何时在棋道初窥门径，再谈不迟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/28/ft6030g07wdg3mt0dknucbpx69rw4sf.mp3","text":"棋道玄妙，终归只是棋而已。在棋盘上学不会用兵之道、权术人心。我的确见过不少喜好穿凿附会的人，至于你说的将军端坐营帐，手谈间轻松破敌的故事......为将者战时行乐，依炎律当斩。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/2tzp34qksfo8860abydwwtljnl26vhz.mp3","text":"我的那些弟弟妹妹，以前从不曾见过他们这般荒唐的样子。这番事了，他们倒像多了许多时间可以浪费。不必让他们知道我也来了这里，如此相安无事便好......你说已经告知过他们了？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_004.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/q9u5alh9h6d1bkbi7atlvl3d6rdufq8.mp3","text":"这几日在罗德岛为客，要是有可以替你分忧的地方，自当出力。可是医疗公司的种种事务，你也不必问计于我......手谈一局？等你何时在棋道初窥门径，再谈不迟。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/45/l3oqtxsdk3rx3dfob1prtn61sv5ngj6.mp3","text":"棋道玄妙，终归只是棋而已。在棋盘上学不会用兵之道、权术人心。我的确见过不少喜好穿凿附会的人，至于你说的将军端坐营帐，手谈间轻松破敌的故事......为将者战时行乐，依炎律当斩。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/dd/kd4mujhyv5axlacdr9d1bd5hgkuwdn7.mp3","text":"我的那些弟弟妹妹，以前从不曾见过他们这般荒唐的样子。这番事了，他们倒像多了许多时间可以浪费。不必让他们知道我也来了这里，如此相安无事便好......你说已经告知过他们了？","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/hpgulvxark3p61o3zujer7w8zg8b75f.mp3","text":"以求胜之心寻求和之道。只在这一点上，兵戈之事与棋理可谓相通。人们在种种不堪的争斗中寻找出路，也因此才有未来可言。我算不出你的将来，但相信你做出的选择，是合乎棋理的本手。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/24/i38roonzx8ythqdefoip3xix5inbofy.mp3","text":"与祂的这局棋已经作罢，恩怨盈亏，都到此为止。能算是赢吗，只是为了找到在这世间的位置，我们付出的代价已足够沉重。取舍二字的分量，你应当懂......落子无悔，当真能无悔吗。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_006.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9d/siurc9hh0wubquij95850pqoib03d4g.mp3","text":"以求胜之心寻求和之道。只在这一点上，兵戈之事与棋理可谓相通。人们在种种不堪的争斗中寻找出路，也因此才有未来可言。我算不出你的将来，但相信你做出的选择，是合乎棋理的本手。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/18/s3vft4jnmttuxgyrc9f57zh2ajv5abd.mp3","text":"与祂的这局棋已经作罢，恩怨盈亏，都到此为止。能算是赢吗，只是为了找到在这世间的位置，我们付出的代价已足够沉重。取舍二字的分量，你应当懂......落子无悔，当真能无悔吗。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d1/cisxmjhw6ostbezs376e3slltfku7a4.mp3","text":"我们已经没有要留下什么的执念了，只是各自花了上千年学会的一技之长，也算人世变幻的一点见证，被忘记到底可惜......他们能留下的东西大都是宝贵的，唯独我不该去做传道授业的事。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/61/4111kp3zjb80ui7hyc4sxvyh878axr6.mp3","text":"于我们而言，长幼之分本就荒谬，就算是这世上的寻常人家，也不见兄长事事都要为弟妹做主。你不必再替我那位兄长传话，等这局作罢我自然会去吃晚饭。我知道今天是余弟下厨。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/8rwk4ri60vdefxqiofrafn2t3gw009k.mp3","text":"我算尽了每一种结果，还是看不到那个浊水复清的结局。但是我知道她就在那里，棋谱中的某一手，史书中的某一页。只是这样相信，便足够了......何必问我的决心，你应当也有牵挂的人。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_009.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/24/53hp194940ml3609a7ebnx4pti79q9u.mp3","text":"我们已经没有要留下什么的执念了，只是各自花了上千年学会的一技之长，也算人世变幻的一点见证，被忘记到底可惜......他们能留下的东西大都是宝贵的，唯独我不该去做传道授业的事。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f4/peqn5dbzpihm8k3y0x4jdy8ro6je2h2.mp3","text":"于我们而言，长幼之分本就荒谬，就算是这世上的寻常人家，也不见兄长事事都要为弟妹做主。你不必再替我那位兄长传话，等这局作罢我自然会去吃晚饭。我知道今天是余弟下厨。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/30/oyccdm2beli6vksmpy8e1xoyci8aqq1.mp3","text":"我算尽了每一种结果，还是看不到那个浊水复清的结局。但是我知道她就在那里，棋谱中的某一手，史书中的某一页。只是这样相信，便足够了......何必问我的决心，你应当也有牵挂的人。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/r20dwg48q9ywlpod5lkkbhle8vazn1e.mp3","text":"......别后竹窗风雪夜......","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_010.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/11/6abldqrwdmi8v44c2s8t4yts1wht6f6.mp3","text":"......别后竹窗风雪夜......","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ed/mhzjojrd3vc27lhpkdskneqhuerdg3v.mp3","text":"你就是博士？久仰。你既已见过不少我的兄弟姐妹，那便不必过多介绍。称呼我望便好，曾是一介谋士。更早之前的相遇......就当是无足挂齿的旧事吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_011.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/26/2so24gklhv0sog2iyv2fgc5usey59ae.mp3","text":"你就是博士？久仰。你既已见过不少我的兄弟姐妹，那便不必过多介绍。称呼我望便好，曾是一介谋士。更早之前的相遇......就当是无足挂齿的旧事吧。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f4/98hufy5e4h7izcmzoqrgkfo2p8qt2ij.mp3","text":"其中破绽，当真要我一一指给你看？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_012.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/q74kvfdwfsx920kyieg8emlw9fcqg4w.mp3","text":"其中破绽，当真要我一一指给你看？","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3a/ks586ty1f2y13pmsaiwlkkwlfc0zfnn.mp3","text":"炎国棋手共分九品，从末品守拙，到一品入神。现在看来，你的棋力大概是在......这是要为我定品？荒唐......","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_013.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5d/oz6fcfqjjxh295e695ykhnwm618rza2.mp3","text":"炎国棋手共分九品，从末品守拙，到一品入神。现在看来，你的棋力大概是在......这是要为我定品？荒唐......","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:6/60/2zk0uw8k7a8d8u0a1o5joen5r1633z1.mp3","text":"从来都只是“我”而已。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_014.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f9/dykxewcak17sfxy7xclf8vaanlp28ph.mp3","text":"从来都只是“我”而已。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fa/4rowpmgvumdtgqjdnt37pwa9n5wms1l.mp3","text":"庙算在前，此战的结果，你心中应当有数。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_017.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/kuwc3i6gtge29zbmqe8n86ten0bec2u.mp3","text":"庙算在前，此战的结果，你心中应当有数。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/kbvd8780sla9h3bwm7axqq9sfi98les.mp3","text":"当真要将这杖节交予我手......？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_018.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/72/71zoipyn7hvex7oewwui174vretb148.mp3","text":"当真要将这杖节交予我手......？","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/sh60tyhp8k61hpnnnhtc4w3qtkp1mya.mp3","text":"三军听令，出征。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_019.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8c/kkyjur3t5h45uam45444r9423mpncdm.mp3","text":"三军听令，出征。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/f4hgcw6vuxvbd3fkmt7w92uv73o0huk.mp3","text":"还请各位，一一入座。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_020.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8d/ea5islvwpclo8t6ty6cbjffph3ojtyh.mp3","text":"还请各位，一一入座。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ab/eytptvy1dc6p55zb6wat8axr2hg1njp.mp3","text":"生杀予夺，抉择在你。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/34/jnjj0fzsn9r5ejdus5lf7m306qtlvwz.mp3","text":"只管落子便是，何必问我？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_022.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/76/1ogjhphbqommwimnzqucjr5fvaxiycs.mp3","text":"生杀予夺，抉择在你。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2e/fkql9aqaps0sgmnx0ubluuao1pvlld3.mp3","text":"只管落子便是，何必问我？","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/tl56hru9abihy7wqn1tirfp7ni1dtpr.mp3","text":"眼观全局，胜负不在一处。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/rrxzf5ol3o618vj1uor5rmcu3a5g625.mp3","text":"都已入我局中。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_024.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/13/3m990kj9zg336dgewi8in4n20dbam94.mp3","text":"眼观全局，胜负不在一处。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/16/2e0okueucqguxj6insam2974q6gqj9a.mp3","text":"都已入我局中。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0f/7kdp0habdrzjt284mf4zj8znq1uc8t1.mp3","text":"穷兵黩武，你们还是不曾有长进。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/9u5phb0wdipvklp4ml446ut4mnluoxb.mp3","text":"难逃一劫。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/99/azjzw4oc86aottp42x8483g610y55b6.mp3","text":"到此认负，局面还不算难堪。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1f/krxiv1c7825udxtfam07exwt1yyd4cg.mp3","text":"......何必苦苦挣扎？！","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_028.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/lry7q0kunipqno4hqstuut6v6yq1r2c.mp3","text":"穷兵黩武，你们还是不曾有长进。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8d/2lete26u9qtsdr6u7hnu9xnc24tcntl.mp3","text":"难逃一劫。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/68/39zh54xpw67dpxvals8xjckxxvl9tsz.mp3","text":"到此认负，局面还不算难堪。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fd/4hmhpyah4ejjvw1qjei5q83q1b3po1f.mp3","text":"......何必苦苦挣扎？！","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:9/90/ly5bud33qu4yykjpntqk9ibvb1fhcya.mp3","text":"......也算尽兴。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_029.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e5/rflvmp7j44u7b5wws39esqtwom4mamw.mp3","text":"......也算尽兴。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a5/8pjkl0kwlr9yf39cax5r7uimekfza8j.mp3","text":"拿去吧，战报无须让我过目。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_030.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ea/0p0h8otonwb94w6wcwyrn1nxscqo8no.mp3","text":"拿去吧，战报无须让我过目。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fd/pg5129a9l0w4jctqgf3n504ppwgyycb.mp3","text":"昏招频出。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_031.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0c/gr5p7ngieu7n9q5bvxzwkdsb9k1afqp.mp3","text":"昏招频出。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/skikpyyaf8fkiowh5hczp5iku6ccgjp.mp3","text":"有些手段......再来一局如何？！","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_032.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/43/9315l7b3eeey1r4j73otmdcof3qv6mh.mp3","text":"有些手段......再来一局如何？！","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a3/9vwu1asks47joitbhmdazq5sknbbxc5.mp3","text":"......比起那处住所，到底要宽敞许多。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_033.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/3m9s3pqp5elg497yq6aoao124kgm68w.mp3","text":"......比起那处住所，到底要宽敞许多。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8b/9z4kh76mlt6qkxv3vfwyab9uked3uoz.mp3","text":"......观棋不语。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_034.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/10/bqcgdbarfe2kc9dtvtax46mth5puzoy.mp3","text":"......观棋不语。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:7/75/ko4jtt1eclbh62d6yhng52k4yk8mgkh.mp3","text":"今日得空，对弈无妨。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_036.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/81/rbwos98ukybfuwx0d06vbtljuho1mfr.mp3","text":"今日得空，对弈无妨。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:5/58/460pgqb7ptkcxhx3k8nin7xyucmgsfe.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_037.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/1yjth769ib1ah92gct0yqzegrvl8hac.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ec/acm1pqkmasurrtxc49ntbq5ft5dpfml.mp3","text":"祂以“岁”为名，看来古时人们便知，光阴是只骇人恶兽。万事万物都经不住时间消磨，我也不知道我对她的记忆还能留存多久，至少要在那之前......好了，不必再催，我过来吃饭便是。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_038.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2b/lmojd29rfksrk9wzbeu9psmmzevnvhl.mp3","text":"祂以“岁”为名，看来古时人们便知，光阴是只骇人恶兽。万事万物都经不住时间消磨，我也不知道我对她的记忆还能留存多久，至少要在那之前......好了，不必再催，我过来吃饭便是。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:0/09/2brvccrauux5s8615ic9sdox5z356n3.mp3","text":"博士。听某人说起过，你没有早起的习惯。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2027_wang/cn_042.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/ff/nmv9diwcrivaqrtzttt0jyskmi1y7j5.mp3","text":"博士。听某人说起过，你没有早起的习惯。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2027_wang_cn_topolect/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f6/lsrcz2pxwegui6g1v5afyb0rqcan7qb.mp3","text":"炎国数百年前就已经没有“棋待诏”这一官职，而你竟然......只是想让我帮你处理这些文书？不，我不明白你说的“分身乏术”是什么意思。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7c/nowe8yi4g5sg2lyofp7zj9t5fyw3v17.mp3","text":"这几日在罗德岛为客，要是有可以替你分忧的地方，自当出力。可是医疗公司的种种事务，你也不必问计于我......手谈一局？等你何时在棋道初窥门径，再谈不迟。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/46/eis9wbavlttcc4aer3j8h77h6w60t14.mp3","text":"棋道玄妙，终归只是棋而已。在棋盘上学不会用兵之道、权术人心。我的确见过不少喜好穿凿附会的人，至于你说的将军端坐营帐，手谈间轻松破敌的故事......为将者战时行乐，依炎律当斩。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/kp9kju1vu94i58wzoctb4aqw43coz0j.mp3","text":"我的那些弟弟妹妹，以前从不曾见过他们这般荒唐的样子。这番事了，他们倒像多了许多时间可以浪费。不必让他们知道我也来了这里，如此相安无事便好......你说已经告知过他们了？","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0d/ollp5pmnjb0d98400wtt7ptnm2syz0w.mp3","text":"以求胜之心寻求和之道。只在这一点上，兵戈之事与棋理可谓相通。人们在种种不堪的争斗中寻找出路，也因此才有未来可言。我算不出你的将来，但相信你做出的选择，是合乎棋理的本手。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/54/j8l2mw0gk5vhg9exud494e5jafcb4ab.mp3","text":"与祂的这局棋已经作罢，恩怨盈亏，都到此为止。能算是赢吗，只是为了找到在这世间的位置，我们付出的代价已足够沉重。取舍二字的分量，你应当懂......落子无悔，当真能无悔吗。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:5/54/ha0l1rrpmyd2efiryqmnixdopwu5xrq.mp3","text":"我们已经没有要留下什么的执念了，只是各自花了上千年学会的一技之长，也算人世变幻的一点见证，被忘记到底可惜......他们能留下的东西大都是宝贵的，唯独我不该去做传道授业的事。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f6/to94r8o0eqp0h2vqargrpbasficokg4.mp3","text":"于我们而言，长幼之分本就荒谬，就算是这世上的寻常人家，也不见兄长事事都要为弟妹做主。你不必再替我那位兄长传话，等这局作罢我自然会去吃晚饭。我知道今天是余弟下厨。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/hxdkb89d7lgf4ytrdhy9wih7f985z3b.mp3","text":"我算尽了每一种结果，还是看不到那个浊水复清的结局。但是我知道她就在那里，棋谱中的某一手，史书中的某一页。只是这样相信，便足够了......何必问我的决心，你应当也有牵挂的人。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d3/koc6y3xy5wsfis42jhg78rt9i9m2jxa.mp3","text":"......别后竹窗风雪夜......","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:0/07/tjovy8s8nyczjmm0ojb9yzqrlduw4yz.mp3","text":"你就是博士？久仰。你既已见过不少我的兄弟姐妹，那便不必过多介绍。称呼我望便好，曾是一介谋士。更早之前的相遇......就当是无足挂齿的旧事吧。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:8/85/p9yn2ew0nilpjx7hcyk1g41m3vj6raz.mp3","text":"其中破绽，当真要我一一指给你看？","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cc/d4g7cbldq74csuxav11k1gh5q6a2w5z.mp3","text":"炎国棋手共分九品，从末品守拙，到一品入神。现在看来，你的棋力大概是在......这是要为我定品？荒唐......","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:8/88/52x0mm6vb4qbdoycfraiagu9n5a7dgz.mp3","text":"从来都只是“我”而已。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4b/4luoiiti9sv1qni4cfwf4ddn5itkc7m.mp3","text":"庙算在前，此战的结果，你心中应当有数。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b8/dxgw7aw6z9dym1420rhee3fda67jo9x.mp3","text":"当真要将这杖节交予我手......？","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/gd2kbcuwk9acxbt9d1w2vyx12cdyih1.mp3","text":"三军听令，出征。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9b/s2j6ca6l70vj8ulgyocx1leh62q7lmm.mp3","text":"还请各位，一一入座。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7c/j55pcquw0sxyzyskqwwyuenkaya1klj.mp3","text":"生杀予夺，抉择在你。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/69/t5h7rjknd369rh8sgl35i43yvjcn27e.mp3","text":"只管落子便是，何必问我？","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/rpv6xs1slug57dkrp7dkcq293ntno5m.mp3","text":"眼观全局，胜负不在一处。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8b/tcv9gxfnnfmgg8ak4uf5uxmp1qicj37.mp3","text":"都已入我局中。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:7/78/5zudjvujfhhn5hfxy407cmqgh5wv5xz.mp3","text":"穷兵黩武，你们还是不曾有长进。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/0rp16rj3i28ffr4nmqsmll97y3rzpxa.mp3","text":"难逃一劫。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5b/7n2pjr13gjnv79s0jn8jveenktlo2x0.mp3","text":"到此认负，局面还不算难堪。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/bw6r2ozo3avwy3unrkjkm07zrj7zfsb.mp3","text":"......何必苦苦挣扎？！","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e2/emb00cqtqshg3dlrxrz0y4gzucxhikp.mp3","text":"......也算尽兴。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/pfh0eyn7pp8uxynaxg70sh9zmc8vnvm.mp3","text":"拿去吧，战报无须让我过目。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/ml01xt1fet9l5gjrll707ipsta7ywlq.mp3","text":"昏招频出。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:2/24/o2af82dyizgly979dqa8fs00zq5hbqo.mp3","text":"有些手段......再来一局如何？！","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ed/15gnei4t99we7hdvteds5qzjjma2vcj.mp3","text":"......比起那处住所，到底要宽敞许多。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b8/njxus1p12rb8kkwp7493qgdmjx7xn0a.mp3","text":"......观棋不语。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a4/osz2o425dq4veemyx8v1036nw41pepz.mp3","text":"今日得空，对弈无妨。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/pex3y92hrj1p37jd18tq882ws7r98ht.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/oryfjest61uqb48pzdc3du62de8hooc.mp3","text":"祂以“岁”为名，看来古时人们便知，光阴是只骇人恶兽。万事万物都经不住时间消磨，我也不知道我对她的记忆还能留存多久，至少要在那之前......好了，不必再催，我过来吃饭便是。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:6/63/lyyx1jm6lktlf0ywu2c4yhbcw5j6xh6.mp3","text":"博士。听某人说起过，你没有早起的习惯。","alt":"voice/char_2027_wang/cn_042.mp3"}]}}